    "summary": "The King of the Timbales. Started on drum kit in the image of his idol Gene Krupa, then moved to timbales and brought them to the front of the band as a solo instrument. Led one of the Palladium's 'Big Three' mambo orchestras, wrote 'Oye Como Va' and 'Ran Kan Kan', and danced the timbales for dancers. A trained arranger and conductor as well as a showman."
